WEBVTT

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.660
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.660
<b>Enemy?                              The battle begins!                              Enemy</b>

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.660
<b>Team ?                       Team Taiki                    Team Kiriha</b>

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.660
Mysterious
Girl

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.660
<b>Enemy?                                    Enemy?

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.660
Rival

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.660
Protagonist

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.660
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.280
When I tried to save someone

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.490
who sounded like he was 
on the verge of death,

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:18.890
I was taken to this mysterious 
place called the Digital World.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:23.800
There I met Shoutmon and 
lots of other Digimon.

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:28.510
This world is having a lot of trouble 
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.630
So, how will we see our way 
through the danger today?

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:45.990
<b>Upheaval in the Island Zone!</b>

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.350
Upheaval in the Island Zone!

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:53.530
It's a Code Crown.

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.010
Who are you?

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:58.430
Nene Amano.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:01.770
Shall I tell you what 
that is, Taiki Kudou?

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:03.680
How do you know my name?

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:07.010
I've been watching you in action.

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:08.940
Then you've seen me in action, too?

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:11.750
Did you do something?

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.920
I'm number one in Koto Ward!

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.490
So what is this Code Crown?

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:20.900
The Code Crown symbolizes 
control of each Zone.

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:24.310
When the Digital World 
was divided into Zones,

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:26.460
the Code Crown was also shattered.

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:29.910
What you have there is a 
fragment of the original.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:33.760
Now that you mention it, 
it's been said that

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:37.510
a piece of that Code Whatchamacallit 
exists in each Zone.

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:39.920
<i>Now</i> you remember?!

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:42.240
Since you obtained the Code Crown,

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.850
this Zone is now yours.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:44.810
Mine?

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:46.630
That's awesome, Taiki!

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:49.560
One Code Crown exists for each Zone.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.530
Whoever obtains all of 
them gains the ability

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:56.530
to make the Digital World 
into whatever he pleases.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:01.930
So if I get all of these, 
I can become the Digimon King?

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:05.470
The Bagra Army has a tremendous 
advantage, though.

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:08.410
And then there's that Kiriha guy.

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:14.160
Put the Code Crown in your Xros Loader

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:15.950
and say, "Change Zone."

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:27.430
Change Zone!

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.750
It opened a path.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:42.140
We can get to the next Zone this way?

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:43.410
Yes.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:46.130
If we collect all the Code Crowns,

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:49.160
maybe we could get back to our own world!

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:50.820
We have no choice but to try.

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:52.990
We'll accompany you, too.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:58.660
They went in!

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:00.770
When you change Zones,

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:03.260
your Digimon enter your Xros Loader.

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:04.820
Just who are you?

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:07.030
Why are you telling us all this?

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.730
Because...

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:11.770
I like strong boys who can fight.

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:13.640
Understood!

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:15.800
Then I'll fight with all my strength!

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.430
Ow...

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.710
Are you okay, Taiki?

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:22.010
Sorry. I guess I got 
a little overexcited.

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.850
Hey, she's gone!

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.450
Who was that girl, anyway?

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:31.760
A mysterious beauty! 
I wonder if we'll see her again.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.850
Let's go, too.

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:35.330
All we can do now is move forward.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:41.810
We're floating...

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:43.790
Wow, cool!

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:44.740
That way!

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:52.380
Is that the exit?

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.210
The sea!

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:03.250
There's some weird pattern on the sky...

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.230
This is the sea?

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:07.590
I've never seen it before!

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.450
Isn't this great, Akari?

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:10.760
You kept talking about 
Marine Day, after all.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.250
All I cared about was the squid ink pasta

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:15.900
that's only sold on Marine Day.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.950
I really wanted some...

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.140
Stop!

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.080
Where is this Zone's Code Crown?

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.110
Don't draw this out any longer.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:33.220
Draw out... draw out...

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:34.320
Draw!

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:36.090
Stop joking around, you big turtle!

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:42.760
Hey! What are you guys doing?

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.410
Humans?

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:48.570
Well, human or not, all who oppose us...

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:50.070
will meet their doom!

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:55.940
Shoutmon!

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.080
Ballistamon!

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.440
DigiXros!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.540
Shoutmon!

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.450
Ballistamon!

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:15.030
DigiXros!

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.090
Shoutmon X2!

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:39.160
Take some of this!

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:41.850
Starmon!

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:43.020
Pickmons!

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.460
DigiXros!

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:46.690
Starmon!

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:50.230
Pickmons!

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.190
Sparkle!

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:03.110
Star Axe!

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:08.180
What?!

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:19.120
Gizamon troops, retreat for now!

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:22.990
Archelomon, are you all right?

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:26.400
Who are you?

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:29.860
You've forgotten me?!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.910
Oh! You're... Ji... Ji...

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.010
Jijimon!

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:38.700
Oh, that's right!

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:41.610
The elder of the Village of Smiles.

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:43.920
Archelomon is the head of this island.

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:48.290
These kids saved our village.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:52.240
The Bagra Army is after 
this island's Code Crown?

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:53.020
Hey!

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:56.360
Give it to us before 
the Bagra Army gets it!

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:57.780
And you are?

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:59.760
The future Digimon King.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.800
The King! That's amazing!

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:04.600
This is my General.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.570
Where's the Code Crown?

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:11.030
It's in a place that won't 
be so easy to take it from.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:15.050
It can only be accessed 
during the Summer Festival.

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:18.150
So we have to wait for 
the Summer Festival?

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:20.900
Festival! Festival!

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:22.190
What kind of festival is it?

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.350
We make an offering at the shrine,

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:27.430
then do a dance to pray for 
our safety in the coming year.

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:28.890
An offering of what?

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:31.330
Lots and lots of DigiNoir.

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:36.940
Lots and lots of DigiNoir!

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:38.010
DigiNoir?

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:39.380
You don't know?

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.040
It's the finest cuisine 
in the Digital World!

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:45.110
There are many trees on this 
island that produce DigiNoir.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:47.440
We sure wound up in a nice place!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.080
The ground shook...

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:54.780
That's a sign that it's almost 
time for the festival.

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:57.150
We must go gather more 
food for the offering.

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:58.420
I'll go! I'll go! I'll go!

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.330
I'll show you the way!

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:04.000
Wait! That Bagra Army 
is sure to attack again!

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.940
But we can't fight on an empty stomach!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:31.220
A human with a red Xros 
Loader interfered?

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:31.910
Yes, sir.

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:35.340
And that is why you came 
crawling back like a coward?!

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:39.180
I am truly sorry!

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:47.230
Lord Tactimon.

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:51.460
The humans who claimed the 
Green Zone are headed your way.

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:55.700
They are most likely seeking 
the Code Crown as well.

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:58.220
Do not let them have it, at any cost.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.320
Do you understand, Neptunemon?

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:01.290
Yes, sir.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.500
I won't go easy on them any longer.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:11.100
I will go to that island myself, 
crush those humans,

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:14.600
and take their Code Crown!

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:18.190
Bagra Army Mantaraymon fleet, advance!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:38.170
After I came all this way 
for a swim in the ocean,

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:40.060
it looks like it's about 
to get noisy around here...

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:51.380
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:53.720
They may be made up of data,

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:57.960
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:01.090
Join us in our world of adventure

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:04.220
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:05.280
DigiXros!

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:43.550
Look how many I got!

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.050
Yum, yum!

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:50.730
This is the best thing I've tasted 
since we came to this world!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.630
You said it!

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:52.690
I can't stop!

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:58.640
Seconds for you, sir.

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:00.370
Oh, thanks!

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:08.370
If I eat a lot, can I become stronger?

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.280
You want to be stronger?

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:17.990
I want to protect this island.

00:12:17.990 --> 00:12:21.050
I know I'm small, 
but I want to be stronger.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.570
All right, then!

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:25.390
To thank you for showing me 
the way to the DigiNoir trees,

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.820
I'll give you a special lesson.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:28.960
What you need to be stronger is...

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:32.030
courage, spirit, and good friends.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:34.970
Courage, spirit, and good friends?

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:38.380
That's right. You saw our 
DigiXros, didn't you?

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:40.410
If you've got good friends, 
you can be stronger!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:45.580
You may be little, 
but you can still help your friends.

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:46.840
I know it.

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:51.780
Sir Archelomon!

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:54.150
What is it, Sha... Sha...

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:55.720
I'm Shakomon!

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:58.160
And a giant manta is coming this way!

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:13.100
Listen up!

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.940
Show our foes no mercy!

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:18.660
Raze the island and find the Code Crown!

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:21.020
Hangyo troops, commence landfall!

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:25.350
What are all those half-fish guys?

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:28.870
No, those are... Han... Han...

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.890
Sir Archelomon! They're Hangyomon!

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:32.710
They just keep coming.

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.560
Let's whip every last one of them!

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:35.660
We can't.

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:38.470
Only one squadron has come up on land.

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:40.060
There are still lots more out there.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:42.420
You mean there are 
hundreds more than this?

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.330
What are they, cockroaches?

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:45.330
And all we have are the few of us.

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:47.900
If we take them on one by one, 
it would never end.

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:49.010
Then what do we do?

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.860
They have cannons!

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:57.850
We can't win against those!

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.810
Have you heard of tomoe nage?

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:01.860
Who's Tomoe?

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.820
Taiki, just because you 
helped the judo club once,

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:05.880
how can you think...

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:07.740
When the opponent strikes,

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:10.020
you pretend to fall on your back,

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:14.170
and use your opponent's own 
force to throw them overhead.

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:16.500
But who is Tomoe, Taiki?

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:21.330
There's nobody here.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:23.240
They must have already run off in fear.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.610
You think this will work?

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:49.100
Intruders?!

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:56.610
Ocean!

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.250
Koto Slice!

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:07.150
Heavy Speaker!

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:10.220
Rowdy Rocker!

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:17.170
Why do I have to go through 
with this ninja act, too?

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:18.870
You got to swim in the ocean, didn't you?

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.460
Let's go, guys!

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:27.140
What's going on?!

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:33.650
What?!

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:44.210
Not one target missed!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:47.230
I always played shooter 
games with my brothers,

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:48.450
so I'm good at this stuff!

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:54.510
The enemy has commandeered our fleet?

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:55.300
What foolishness is this?!

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:59.500
Enjoy that feeling of 
triumph while you can!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.680
That takes care of all the battleships.

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:06.940
Next we wipe out the 
enemies on the island!

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:13.630
The plan is a success!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:14.390
Wow...

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:16.240
They're attacking!

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:18.090
Don't panic.

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:21.630
Here I go!

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:23.800
What is that?!

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:40.280
Oh, no! It's Octomon!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:45.550
Shoutmon!

00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:46.500
Ballistamon!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.590
DigiXros!

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:50.620
Shoutmon!

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:53.890
Ballistamon!

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:01.700
DigiXros!

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:12.500
Shoutmon X2!

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:15.410
Starmon!

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:16.610
Pickmons!

00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:18.050
DigiXros!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:19.950
Starmon!

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:23.910
Pickmons!

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:30.090
One more time!

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:34.010
Star Axe!

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.260
Is this the end?

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:50.010
They can't fight a marine 
Digimon underwater!

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:58.160
<i>You may be little, 
but you can still help your friends.</i>

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:00.160
I know it.

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:04.730
ChibiKamemon!

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:07.250
Wait, ChibiKamemon!

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:16.510
<i>I can't breathe underwater!</i>

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:18.750
<i>Crap, I can't get away...</i>

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:20.040
<i>Can't breathe...</i>

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:28.520
You're powerless to resist now, X2!

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:33.420
<i>Is he...</i>

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:37.370
<i>I can hear it...</i>

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:40.470
<i>His desire to help, to fight beside us.</i>

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:46.890
<i>No way!</i>

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:48.940
<i>Is he thinking of making us 
Xros with a runt like him?</i>

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.660
Shoutmon X2!

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:53.650
ChibiKamemon!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.230
DigiXros!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.390
We're saved!

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:10.660
I can breathe underwater now!

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:13.430
Impudence!

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.140
Take this!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:29.080
Spurting Ink!

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.820
You missed!

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:43.060
Hold it!

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:45.330
You little...

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:57.440
Buddy Blaster!

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:18.000
That was a totally unexpected 
DigiXros, but it worked well.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.060
Thanks, ChibiKamemon.

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:23.980
You're pretty strong!

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:26.630
And now, you're one of us!

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:29.470
Our hearts Xrosed back there, after all.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.710
They even defeated Octomon?

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.800
Orders from Lord Neptunemon.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.080
Our next strategy has been put in place.

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.640
What?

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:44.520
It seems he has learned the 
whereabouts of the Code Crown.

